OL,3,ABurnham addressing MPs in Commons for
OL,4,Afirst time since becoming PM
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham is addressing the House of
OL,7,FCommons - and taking questions from MPs
OL,8,F- for the first time as prime minister.
OL,9,FWatch live at the top of the page
OL,11,FHe begins by paying tribute to his
OL,12,Fpredecessor Keir Starmer for his
OL,13,F"lifetime of public service", and
OL,14,Fpledges to continue his support for
OL,15,FUkraine
OL,17,FBurnham met his cabinet this morning as
OL,18,FMPs return to Westminster after the
OL,19,Fsummer recess
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/38
