OL,3,ASummer 2026 was UK's hottest on record,
OL,4,AMet Office says
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a study on how this summer was
OL,7,Fimpacted by human-induced climate
OL,8,Fchange, the Met Office says the heat
OL,9,Fexperienced this summer was made 130
OL,10,Ftimes more likely.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
